### 1. 创建时空胶囊 (Create)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/create?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "故宫的春日记忆",
  "content": "今天天气真好，红墙黄瓦配上蓝天，绝美！这是一个值得铭记的时刻。",
  "decoration": "复古相框",
  "color": "red",
  "isPublic": true,
  "date": "2026-03-03",
  "location": {
    "name": "故宫博物院",
    "address": "北京市东城区景山前街4号",
    "lat": 39.916345,
    "lng": 116.397155,
    "city": "北京市",
    "country": "中国"
  },
  "images": [
    {
      "url": "https://your-oss-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/test-capsule/gugong_main.jpg",
      "type": "image",
      "thumbnail": "https://your-oss-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/test-capsule/gugong_main.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,m_fill,w_300,h_300",
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080
    },
    {
      "url": "https://your-oss-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/test-capsule/gugong_corner.mp4",
      "type": "video"
    }
  ]
}

### 更新时空胶囊 (Update)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/1/update?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "故宫的春日记忆-更新版",
  "content": "修改一下文案，风景依然很美。",
  "decoration": "现代相框",
  "color": "blue",
  "isPublic": false,
  "date": "2026-03-04",
  "location": {
    "name": "故宫博物院神武门",
    "address": "北京市东城区景山前街4号",
    "lat": 39.916345,
    "lng": 116.397155,
    "city": "北京市",
    "country": "中国"
  },
  "images": [
    {
      "url": "https://your-oss-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/test-capsule/gugong_main.jpg",
      "type": "image",
      "thumbnail": "https://your-oss-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/test-capsule/gugong_main.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,m_fill,w_300,h_300",
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080
    }
  ]
}


### 2. 查询用户创建的所有胶囊 (Get List by User)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/user/1


### 3. 根据地名查询胶囊 (Get List by Location)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/location?locationName=故宫博物院


### 4. 查看单个胶囊侧详细信息 (Get Detail)
# 前提：请将上一步POST创建后返回的 ID 替换掉此处的 `1`
GET http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/1/detail?currentUserId=1


### 5. 删除胶囊 (Delete)
# 前提：请将真实存在的 capsuleId 替换此处的 `1`
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/capsule/1?userId=1

###创建用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "lty",
    "password": "123456",
    "name": "lty",
    "grade": 1,
    "avatar": "",
    "telephone": "13800138000",
    "email": "",
    "location": "上海市"
}

### 获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/lty

### 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "lty",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 设置用户等级（测试 updateInformation）
# 说明：PUT /api/user 接口会用请求中的字段覆盖数据库值，因此请尽量携带完整字段。
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lty",
  "name": "lty",
  "grade": "5",
  "avatar": "http://bluewhale-lsw.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/f6e1655b5fde2a149f692c492b6f5342ca7350eb0476e56f08cafcc2ea7d08bf.jpg",
  "telephone": "13800138000",
  "email": "2217291370@qq.com",
  "location": "上海市"
}

### 获取用户信息（验证等级已更新）
# 预期：grade 为 "5"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/lty

### 给用户增加经验值（测试升级逻辑）
# 说明：当前升级逻辑基于 UserPO.addExperience，只有当累积经验落入 “100*当前等级 ~ 100*(当前等级+1)-1” 区间时，会升级 1 级并扣除 100*当前等级的经验。
# 例如：等级 1 时，经验区间 [100,199] 会升级到 2 级，升级后经验会减去 100。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/lty/experience
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "experience": 200
}

### 再次获取用户信息（验证 grade/experience 变更）
# 预期：grade 从 1 升到 2，experience 应该变为 50
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/lty

### 修改/创建用户健康数据
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/health/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "username": "lty",
  "sex": "man",             
  "height": 175.0,         
  "weight": 70.0,          
  "age": 21,               
  "exerciseDaysPerWeek": 3, 
  "combatPower": 0        
}

### 修改用户健康数据并触发战力值重新计算
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/health/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lty",
  "sex": "man",             
  "height": 175.0,         
  "weight": 70.0,          
  "age": 21,               
  "exerciseDaysPerWeek": 3 
}

### 获取用户的健康数据（可以查看计算出的最新战力值 combatPower）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/health/lty


